            {
                "entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
                "word": "occidentalisme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "370c3653-327f-45f9-b803-ffaff8e91861",
                        "entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "occidentalismes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "76bcfd69-7624-3e3a-a843-c54a95c72c7b",
                        "entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Courant de pensée qui prend l’Occident pour modèle, en défend les valeurs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed907e0f-ae2d-4b4b-8b6b-56abefb5b8ec",
                                "sense_id": "76bcfd69-7624-3e3a-a843-c54a95c72c7b",
                                "text": "Il s’est cristallisé dans l’opposition entre les tenants d’une ligne gaullo-mitterrandiste et les partisans de l’atlantisme, et/ou de l'occidentalisme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0ef0aa4-513c-43a3-915c-7b9e4284f1c2",
                                "sense_id": "76bcfd69-7624-3e3a-a843-c54a95c72c7b",
                                "text": "Dans les majlis, ces conseils où l’on discute entre hommes, l'\"activisme\" et l'\"occidentalisme\" d’Hamad et de la cheikha sont régulièrement critiqués."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "175171e0-21a9-3bbe-9199-dbd15246afe5",
                        "entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Courant de pensée qui prend l’Occident pour modèle, en défend les valeurs.",
                            "Dans la Russie du XIXᵉ siècle, courant de pensée pro-occidental visant à moderniser le pays."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "801514c2-3ebf-4063-ae44-551d0a213755",
                        "source_entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
                        "target_lang_word": "occidentalism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "occidentalism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d452684f-5fcb-3051-89da-4ebaec3077a6",
                                        "entry_id": "59c2a217-8473-3db1-bf34-8a10605c563b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The habits and attitudes of westerners."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8cd579c-4c6f-435b-a6f5-d07f6c4ca9a6",
                                                "sense_id": "d452684f-5fcb-3051-89da-4ebaec3077a6",
                                                "text": "Giving full agency to the Chinese Occidentalists, she argues that Occidentalism was a discourse used within the context of domestic politics in post-Mao China as a “strategy of liberation\" and a counterdiscourse to the government's ideological domination […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5bb7c13-36b4-4f1c-9997-a6a0865f8b4e",
                        "source_entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
                        "target_lang_word": "Westernism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Westernism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78f6dcb6-82b4-31cc-92f1-f291b03cc0e3",
                                        "entry_id": "49533a7a-71be-335c-a25a-5be69031f541",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ideology and culture of the West."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3301ee30-02e4-3b23-bd60-fcf2c1beea84",
                                        "entry_id": "49533a7a-71be-335c-a25a-5be69031f541",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An 19th-century intellectual ideology which saw Russia's development as dependent upon the adoption of Western European technology and liberal government."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df933680-f188-4292-894b-da290f32982f",
                                                "sense_id": "3301ee30-02e4-3b23-bd60-fcf2c1beea84",
                                                "text": "Slavophilism and Westernism were indeed the two sides of the same set of aspirations and sentiments, one facing an image of the past, and the other that of the future."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3415fdd8-1ca4-49e5-83e7-d3a03895c701",
                                                "sense_id": "3301ee30-02e4-3b23-bd60-fcf2c1beea84",
                                                "text": "In the coming decades, the tumult of revolution and war together with the mistakes, compromises, and ambitions of the country's new leaders would bring Russia's \"Asiatic\" heritage to the fore and sweep away a still-fragile Westernism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f14c4e64-38ea-488d-af43-801f33159bd8",
                                                "sense_id": "3301ee30-02e4-3b23-bd60-fcf2c1beea84",
                                                "text": "This description of a typical serious circle exposes the limitation which was so fundamental to Russian Westernism after the failure of the Decembrist revolt—the absence of any relation between thought and practice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4f382df-c820-4b65-bca5-cb057e7e70c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
                        "target_lang_word": "occidentalismo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "481750dc-42d2-4e9c-b3ca-e247b84629aa",
                        "source_entry_id": "be678b76-8be1-398c-9d60-89f8957abdb2",
